!_config/doxygen-extensions/
!_config/doxygen-extensions/doxygen-awesome-css/
**/doxygen*
**/.cache/

**/compile_commands.json

.venv/
**/venv/
**/.venv/

__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/

actionlint*
